# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files, regardless of what OS
# checked them out or which editor touched them. Without this, a Windows
# checkout (CRLF) diffs as a full-file rewrite against the LF blobs already
# in history, so every file looks "modified" with nothing actually changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
